# This repository tracks only what is explicitly un-ignored below.
#
# ~/repos is the parent of every project on this machine. Most of its entries are their own
# git repositories, git worktrees, or local state, and nesting those here would either break
# them or silently swallow them. So the default is to ignore everything, and each project that
# genuinely belongs to this repository is named one line at a time.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/devcompanion/
